OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFine and dry
OL,6,Fthis evening. It will remain rather
OL,7,Fmuggy overnight, with most places
OL,8,Fstaying dry. However, some patchy rain
OL,9,Fmay reach Lincolnshire and the far
OL,10,Fwest around dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FMostly cloudy at first but
OL,13,Fbrightening up, with some sunny spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping. However, winds will
OL,15,Fsteadily strengthen ahead of a band of
OL,16,Frain, mostly light, pushing eastwards
OL,17,Fduring the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
