OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells and isolated blustery showers
OL,7,FTuesday. Winds and showers gradually
OL,8,Feasing Wednesday. Dry with light winds
OL,9,Fand periods of hazy sunshine on
OL,10,FThursday. Temperatures around average
OL,11,Ffor early September.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
